<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Israel Kerikwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Israel Kerikwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Israel Kerikwa</para>
  <para style="mt">Israel Kerikwa</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13" />
  <para style="s">Yagl 12-pela dumo Kenan suna pi doko kanigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="12 spies return" file="FM 106 Twelve Spies Return_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="13.1" />Ana Yawe ere mogl, Moses yegl di togwa, <verse eid="NUM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2" />Na dumo Kenan ene Israel yoba tenaluwa. Na ene tenaglka pre ene yagl tau dedin, ye ede pi dumo Kenan suna doko daka ere kanaiglmiwa. Israel yugobuno 12-pela i mina yagl kade swara swarade kere idre, dedenatniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="NUM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3" />Yegl dugo, Moses ere mogl, Yawe ye di tomere ere, yagl kade wagle i kere idre, dedugo, ye Israel yoba dumo wau yomara Paran we digwa meglmara i kide kodidre, ede eigwa.<verse eid="NUM 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">*************************</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17" />Ana yagl wagle i ede pi dumo Kenan doko daka ere kanaiglmedi Moses dedugwa igne, ye yegl di togwa, Ene komono kana dumo Negev we dimara pidre, dumo i kide kodidre, ede pi dumo muglo paimara ede enaiglmiwa. <verse eid="NUM 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18" />Ene pidre, dumo Kenan siragl mere yogwa i, ene kanaiglmiwa. Makan nem yoba mere meglmo mo suom ta meglmo mo i kandre, yobuglno podo pamo mo paikrumo mo i ama kanaiglmiwa. <verse eid="NUM 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19" />Te, dumo wakai yomo mo kide yomo mo i kandre, makan nem yoba kipai meglmara, taun yoko kipaimo mo kobuglo togl podo ere winabo dimo mo i ama kanaiglmiwa. <verse eid="NUM 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20" />Te, makan gaba nuglo podo pamo mo paikrumo mo i kandre, ede mere paimo mo paikrimo mo i ama kanaiglmiwa. Ana taragl i mudu kandre, ene ede ikne unamnedi eribi, ene ede mogo tau uraiglkwa kuno eran, tau uro idre, ede unaiglmiwe di, Moses yegl dugwa. Moses yegl didre, yagl wagle dedugwa igne i ede wain mogo koglkwa bogl yenagledi erukwa ege yogwa.<verse eid="NUM 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21" />Ana Moses ere mogl, yagl wagle ikra dedugo, ye komono kana ede pi nigl beye kra dumo wau ta yomara Sen we dimara pi kandre, wan ede pi nigl bre kra pidre, dumo ta Rehop we dimara ama kanigwa. Dumo Rehop i, dumo ta Lebo Hamat we dimara magigl yogwa.<verse eid="NUM 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">*************************</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25" />Ana yagl wagle i, ege 40-pela de dumo Kenan suna doko daka ere wan mogl kandre, ede ikne wigwa. <verse eid="NUM 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26" />Ye ede ikne u Moses ya Aron ya Israel yoba mudu dumo wau yomara Paran suna, dumo kebra Kades we digwa i meglmara udre, dumo Kenan siragl mere yogwa i ye di tedre, ede mogo uro yuigwa i, ye obuno di teigwa. <verse eid="NUM 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27" />Yegl ersre, ye Moses di te, yegl digwa, Ene no dumo Kenan pi kanaiglmedi dedingo, no pi kanumga. Dumo i, ka kaima makan nuglo podo moglko, kaya mokna wakai kaima boglkwa. No ede mogo tau uro yumga i, yoma, kano! <verse eid="NUM 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28" />Dumo yegl yogwa ba makan nem yoba we, ye yobuglno podo paugo, ye taun podo kei yedre, taun yeimara kobuglo togl podo ere winabo digwa. Te, yagl ta Anak we digwa i gawama tau dumo Kenan suna meglko, no kamga. Ye yagl olto kuri kaima meglkwa. <verse eid="NUM 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29" />Nigl beye kra dumo Negev we digwa i we, Amalek yoba meglkwa. Te, dumo muglo paimara i we, Hit yoba ya Jebus yoba ya Amor yoba meglkwa. Te, mudi nigl bina ya nigl Jordan bina i we, Kenan yoba meglmiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="NUM 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30" />Ana yagl kade wagle i ka yegl digo, yagl ta kagie Kalep we digwa, ye yagl kade 12-pela ikra mina suna moglkwa i, ye ere mogl, yoba mudu Moses moglmara mogl winabo digwa i di te, Ene ka dikrio! didre, yoba yegl di togwa, Nono dumo Kenan inamga, kuno kaima erabiwe dugwa. Yegl pre nono ede pi Kenan yoba kuda bogl tedre, dumo makan ka kaima inamniwe! di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="NUM 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31" />Kalep yegl dugwa ba yagl tau ye bogl akie eigwa i we, ere mogl, yegl digwa, Nono ede pi yoba i kuda bogl tenamga i, kuno erekrabiwe digwa. Ye yobuglno podo paugo, nono yobuglno podo paikrumiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="NUM 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32" />Yegl didre, ye dumo Kenan doko daka ere kanigwa i kide yomiwe di yoba di te, yegl digwa, No dumo Kenan suna wan mogl, doko daka ere kanumga i, yoba ta dumo i kipanamnedi ebi, mudu goraiglkwa paugwa. Te, makan nem yoba kanumga i, ye mudu yoba podo kide meglme digwa. <verse eid="NUM 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33" />Mudu yoba podo kide meglko, yagl ta kagie Anak we digwa i gawama ama meglko, kanumga. Ye yagl olto kuri kaima meglkwa. No ye kandre, no taragl kebra, mogodo mere yegl munedi prumga. No yegl munedi prumgo, yoba i ama no kandre, no ama yegl meglmedi kanimiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="NUM 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14" />
  <para style="s">Israel yoba ka kane kane digwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1" />Ana yagl kade wagle dumo Kenan yegl yome digo, Israel yoba ka i prisre, eduer kai ere meglko, kamun tagugwa. <verse eid="NUM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2" />Kamun tagugo, Israel yoba mudu ede pi Moses ya Aron miurara pi, ka kane kane didre, ye yegl di teigwa, Nono dumo Isip mogl guna, wakai paugo. Mo, dumo wau yomara magigl i ama guna, wakai paugo. <verse eid="NUM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3" />Ba siragl pre Yawe nono agre i ede dumo Kenan enabe? Kenan yoba nono kuda bogl norsre, nono mudu si goraiglmedi agre i ede enabo? Ye nono yagl mudu si goglsre, ebinoma gagroma si kane sinaiglkwa. Yegl pre nono ede ikne dumo Isip omun, wakai panabiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="NUM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4" />Ye Moses ya Aron yegl di te kodidre, yene di pre, yegl digwa, Nono yagl ta bitno morabedi yedidre, ede ikne pi dumo Isip enamniwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="NUM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5" />Ana Israel yoba yegl digwa pre Moses ya Aron kide kaima prisre, Israel yoba gumuglnomugl dano kra pai, gumano drano makan mina padiurka. <verse eid="NUM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6" />Padiurko, yagl kade 12-pela ede dumo Kenan pi kanigwa ikra, yagl suo Josua ya Kalep, i keme ye deno muduno yubun dogo, gaglno suna ake argla dibrika. Josua, ye yagl ta kagie Nun we digwa i wam moglko, Kalep ye yagl ta kagie Jefune we digwa i wam moglkwa. <verse eid="NUM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7" />Ye gaglno suna ake argla didre, ye Israel yoba mudu yegl di tebrika, No dumo Kenan suna doko daka ere wan mogl, kanumga i, dumo wakai kaima yogwa. <verse eid="NUM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8" />Dumo wakai kaima yogo, makan gaba ama nuglo podo moglko, kaya mokna wakai kaima boglkwa. Yawe nono wakai kanan, ye nono agre i ede pi dumo i suna pidre, nono dumo i norabuka. <verse eid="NUM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9" />Norabuka pre ene Yawe kamo sedekre, dumo Kenan makan nem yoba kuduglno goglkrio! Ye we, ye dua kabu mere yegl meglkwa, nono ye sinamniwa. Yawe nono munara mogl norukwa ba yoba ta ere mogl, Kenan yoba kugl bogl tenabuka ta moglkrukwa. Ye kuduglno goglkrio! di, yegl dibrika. <verse eid="NUM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10" />Josua ya Kalep yegl dibrika ba Israel yoba we, ye ere mogl, Josua ya Kalep kobuglo si goramniwe digwa. Yegl digwa ba Yawe abuglagemo sel yugu yomara mitna i podo sugo, Israel yoba mudu kandre, kide kodigwa.<verse eid="NUM 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">*************************</para>
  <para style="s">God Israel yoba yubun podo togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26" />Ana Yawe ere mogl, Moses ya Aron yegl di togwa, <verse eid="NUM 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27" />Israel yoba ege mere ka kane kane didre, na ka nariko, prika. Ye ka kane kane didre, na ka narikwa i, aunake kide kodinaiglme? <verse eid="NUM 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28" />Ana ene Israel yoba di te, Yawe yegl dumiwe diro! Na ene ka kaima di teiga. Ene okna digwa i, Nono mudu goramniwe digo, prika. Na prika pre erme ene dimere yegl ene ere tenaluwa. <verse eid="NUM 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29" />Ene yoba yagl bugla yugu 20 ne ede mina eigwa, enene okna kerikwa i, ene ka kane kane didre, na ka narikwa pre ene mudu dumo wau yomara magigl i goraiglmiwa. <verse eid="NUM 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30" />Ene ka kaima na dumo ta ene tebo, ene kipanaiglmedi ka giglede di te padiglka i wagle pikre, goraiglmiwa. Yoba yagl bugla yugu 20 ne ede mitna eigwa suna i, Jefune wam Kalep ya Nun wam Josua ye suo keme ede dumo Kenan suna enabrika. <verse eid="NUM 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31" />Ana ene goraiglkwa ba ene gagroma we, ene Kenan yoba ye si kane sinaiglme digwa ba ye kade meglbi, na ye agre i ede pi dumo Kenan suna edibo, ye ene dumo kipana kiurimara suna i, ye kipai moraiglkwa. <verse eid="NUM 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32" />Kipai moraiglkwa ba erme ene yoba kade meglkwa i we, dumo wau yomara magigl i mudu goraiglmiwe dugwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Exodus route map" file="Map_Exodus_Kuman.jpg" size="span" copy="FMOsoft" ref="14.32" /><verse eid="NUM 14:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20" />
  <para style="s">Moses God dumere erekre, muglbomo kobuglo mina sugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1" />Ana namba 1 mun igne, Israel yoba mudu ede pi dumo wau yogwa ta kagie Sen we dimara pi plau didre, dumo kebra Kades we dimara sel yugu kipai meglkwa. Ye dumo i kipai meglko, Moses ya Aron abaro Miriam goglko, ye maugl sigwa.<verse eid="NUM 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2" />Ana Israel yoba sel yugu kipai meglmara i, nigl nenaiglkwa ta moglkrukwa. Nigl ta moglkruko, Israel yoba makai sidre, Moses ya Aron ka tenamnedi pi ye miurara eigwa. <verse eid="NUM 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3" />Ye Moses ya Aron miurara pidre, ye ka te, yegl digwa, No agro tau Yawe gumuglo wagle geglkwa igne i no akie guna, wakai paugo. <verse eid="NUM 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4" />Ene siragl pre no Yawe yobama munga i agre i ede u dumo wau yomara ubre? No aglno buglano bogl akie goraiglmedi agre i ede ubro? <verse eid="NUM 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5" />Siragl eruko, ene no dumo Isip kide kodinaiglmedi agre i ede meda u dumo kide magigl i edibre? Dumo magigl i, kugl mogo nenamga ta paikruko, ede mogo keglkwa ta paikruko, ede wain ama paikrukwa. Te, nigl we, no nigl nenamga ta moglkrumiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="NUM 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6" />Ana Israel yoba ka yegl digo, Moses ya Aron ye meglmara kide kodidre, ede pi Yawe sel yugumo dua wagle pidre, dano kra pai, gumano drano makan mina padiurka. Padiurko, Yawe abuglagemo podo sugo, kanibrika. <verse eid="NUM 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7" />Kanibriko, Yawe ye Moses yegl di togwa, <verse eid="NUM 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8" />Ene Aron muglbomo in, ene Aron bogl Israel yoba mudu di makai sinabriwa. Ene ye di makai sibr, ye kan meglbi, ene kobuglo podo eglke iro paugwa i ka di ten, nigl kobuglo i mina ede meda unabuka. Ene yegl etn, nigl ede meda unan, Israel yoba ye aglno buglano bogl mudu nenaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="NUM 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9" />Ana Yawe yegl dugwa pre Moses ere mogl, ye dumere Yawe sel yugu moglmara pi, Aron muglbomo ikra yugo, <verse eid="NUM 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10" />Aron bogl Israel yoba kobuglo ikra pamara unaiglmedi di makai sibrika. Di makai sibriko, Moses ere mogl, Israel yoba yegl di togwa, Ene prio! Ene ka sedigwa yoba meglkwa. No kobuglo i mina nigl unabedi ere edibugl, unan, ene nenaiglmo? di, Moses yegl dugwa. <verse eid="NUM 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11" />Moses yegl didre, ye muglbo ake mitna ede, kobuglo mina ege suo sugwa. Sugo, nigl podo kuglo si ede meda ugo, Israel yoba ye aglno buglano bogl nigl neigwa. <verse eid="NUM 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12" />Ye nigl neigwa ba Yawe ere mogl, Moses ya Aron yegl di togwa, Ene we, ene na ka kaima dumedi prikre, na kana sedibrika. Ene kana sedibrika i, Israel yoba na yagl kade ka kaimane moglka i kanaiglkwa mere yegl ta erekribrika. Yegl pre ene suo akie Israel yoba agre i ede pi na dumo ta ene tenagle diga i, edekrabriwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="NUM 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13" />Ana Israel yoba dumo igle Yawe ka teigo, Yawe ye yagl kade ka kaimane moglkwa i, Israel yoba kanaiglmedi erukwa pre nigl kobuglo mina ede meda ugwa i, Meriba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru wagle, kagie Meriba mabuno paugwa, Ka Teigwa.</char></note> nigl we digwa.<verse eid="NUM 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">*************************</para>
  <para style="s">Aron goglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22" />Ana okuo Israel yoba mudu dumo Kades kide kodidre, ede pi muglo meglbi Hor we dimara eigwa. <verse eid="NUM 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23" />Muglo meglbi Hor dumo podo Idom we dimara bina yogwa. Ye ede pi dumo i meglko, Yawe ere mogl, Moses ya Aron yegl di togwa, <verse eid="NUM 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24" />Aron erme gorabuka. Ene suo akie Meriba nigl ikra moglsre, na kana sedibrika pre na dumo ta Israel yoba teiga i, Aron suna ta pikrabuka. <verse eid="NUM 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25" />Yegl pre Moses, ene Aron idre, ye wam Eleasar idre, agre i ede pi muglo meglbi Hor we dimara ibo edidre, <verse eid="NUM 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26" />Aron kuguglmo gaglmo gugl edidre, ye wam Eleasar ede tenatniwa. Ede ten, Aron muglo ibo mogl, gorabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="NUM 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27" />Yawe yegl dugo, Moses ye dumere erukwa. Israel yoba mudu kan meglko, Moses yogo, Aron wam bogl yebriko, ye ede muglo ibo eigwa. <verse eid="NUM 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28" />Ye ede muglo ibo eigo, Moses Aron kuguglmo gaglmo gugl edidre, Aron wam Eleasar ede togo, Aron goglkwa. Aron goglko, Moses ya Eleasar ede atne ubrika. <verse eid="NUM 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29" />Ye ede atne ubriko, Israel yoba mudu kan meglkwa i, Aron goglmedi kandre, ege 30-pela de ye kai ere teigwa.<verse eid="NUM 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21" />
  <para style="s">Moses toki kwiamo ta bekugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4" />Ana okuo Israel yoba muglo Hor we dimara i kide kodidre, ye dumo Idom bina winabo dinamnedi pre konbauna ta ede mudi nigl Retsi moglmara ogwa yomara i wagle ede eigwa. Ede eigwa ba ye konbauna pi moglsre, tabre pi kodinamnedi pre oglka erukwa. <verse eid="NUM 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5" />Oglka erukwa pre ye God ya Moses suo akie ka te, yegl digwa, Siragl eruko, ene suo ere mogl, no dumo Isip kide kodinaiglmedi agre i ede meda u, dumo wau yomara magigl i no goraiglmedi edibre? Kaya mokna magigl i paikruko, nigl ama ta moglkrukwa. Te, God bret kide ta norukwa ikra we, no nomga, kide kaima prumniwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="NUM 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6" />Ana Israel yoba ka yegl digo, Yawe ere mogl, toki kide Israel yoba meglmara suna enaiglmedi dedugo, ye pi, Israel yoba kaiglko, Israel yoba tau mere geglkwa. <verse eid="NUM 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7" />Israel yoba tau mere geglko, yoba kor meglkwa i ede u Moses moglmara udre, ye yegl di teigwa, No we, no Yawe ka tedre, ene ka tedre, erumga i, tadaglme erumga. Ene erme Yawe agle di pitn, ye toki kide i no munara kide kodinaiglmedi erabiwe di, yegl digwa. Yegl digo, Moses Israel yoba pre Yawe agle di prukwa. <verse eid="NUM 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8" />Moses ye agle di pruko, Yawe ere mogl, Moses di te, yegl dugwa, Ene toki kide ta bekidre, ede olto wagle padigl, ede i bodugl padratniwa. Bodugl padigln, yoba toki ye giugl kaiglkwa i, u toki kide ene bekenatnga i kanibi, ye goglkre, kor moraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="NUM 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9" />Ana Yawe yegl dugo, Moses ye dumere taragl bras we digwa i tau idre, toki kide ta bekidre, ede olto wagle padiglsre, ede i ake mina ede, bodugl paduglkwa. Ye bodugl paduglko, toki okuo ta yoba ta giugl kaiglkwa i, yoba i ede pi Moses toki kide bekugwa i kandre, goglkre, kor meglkwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Snake on pole" file="BrazenSerpent_bw.jpg" size="span" loc="21.9" copy="Ethnos360" ref="21.9">Israel yoba toki giugl kaiglkwa i, u Moses toki kide bekugwa i kandre, goglkre, kor meglkwa</figure><verse eid="NUM 21:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27" />
  <para style="s">Josua Moses agaimo yugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18-19" />Ana Yawe ere mogl, Moses yegl di togwa, Nun wam Josua we, na Murubuglona ye mina suna moglkwa. Ene Josua agre i pi Eleasar, tawa narukwa yagle i moglmara edin, Israel yoba mudu kan moraiglmiwa. Ye kan meglbi, ene ogon Josua bre wagle bolamugl padiglsre, ye ene againen inabuka i, ene Israel yoba di tenatniwa. <verse eid="NUM 27:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20" />Ene yegl ersre, Israel yoba ye kamo duglo boraiglmedi ene yagl podo motnga namba i tau ye tenatniwa. <verse eid="NUM 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21" />Ana okuo ye na siragl mere ye erabedi praglka i prabuka ta panan, ye tawa narukwa yagle Eleasar i morabara enabuka. Ye enan, Eleasar na di pre, kobuglo tau ye lap ta pirie wagle paugwa i mina kogl padiglkwa ikra kandre, na Josua siragl mere erabedi praglka i di tenabuka. Di tenan, Josua ya Israel yoba mudu ye Eleasar di tenabere keme eraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="NUM 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22" />Yawe yegl dugo, Moses ye di tomere Josua agre i pi Eleasar moglmara edugo, Israel yoba mudu kan meglkwa. <verse eid="NUM 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23" />Israel yoba kan meglko, Moses ye ogo Josua bre mina bolamugl padiglsre, Yawe okna Moses di tomere mere ere, Josua ye agaimo inabuka i, Israel yoba di togwa.<verse eid="NUM 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27" />
</usx>